data: {"id": "db395dbad7744ef6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1575", "run_id": "db395dbad7744ef6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有首轮工具调用已完成。现在汇总事实与证据：\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Namespace**: `aiops-case-v09`\n- **Pod**: `workload`\n- **UID**: `5746c496-b67c-4906-aabb-e71359674305`\n- **状态**: `Running` (Pod 处于 Running 阶段，但容器处于 `Waiting` 状态的 `CrashLoopBackOff`)\n- **节点**: `node2` (172.16.104.20 IP)\n\n### 事实与证据\n\n1.  **当前异常确认**：\n    - `kubectl get yaml` 和 `execute_pod_promql` 均确认 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，重启次数为 10 次。\n    - `describe pod` 显示 `Last State` 为 `Terminated`，`Reason` 为 `Error`，`Exit Code: 1`。\n\n2.  **崩溃直接原因（根因线索）**：\n    - **Previous", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789137639024, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

